# Shopping Cart with Map

Here's a function that adds products to a cart, incrementing quantities for existing items:

```javascript
function addToCart(cart, product) {
  const currentQuantity = cart.get(product) ?? 0;
  cart.set(product, currentQuantity + 1);
  return cart;
}
```

## Example Usage

