## Usage

```javascript
const products = [
  { id: 'apple',  name: 'Apple',  price: 0.5 },
  { id: 'banana', name: 'Banana', price: 0.25 },
  { id: 'apple',  name: 'Apple',  price: 0.5 },
  { id: 'cherry', name: 'Cherry', price: 2.0 },
  { id: 'banana', name: 'Banana', price: 0.25 },
