## Why This Works

- **`cart.get(id) ?? 0`** — returns the existing quantity, or `0` if the product isn't in the cart yet. Using `??` (nullish coalescing) is safer than `||` in case a stored value is ever `0`.
- **`cart.set(id, current + quantity)`** — `Map.set` overwrites any existing value for that key, so it naturally handles both insert and update cases.
- **`quantity = 1` default** — lets you add single items without specifying a count.

